nd she doesn't seem to have many close friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has been a domestic helper since she graduated from school. She grew up in an all-girls' school like her younger sister Kasumi. She has never been in a relationship with a man, so her knowledge of the opposite sex is a little off."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She thinks of the main character as her \"cute and precious little brother,\" but she still sees him as a kid and is a bit overprotective of him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c56034"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d54af096f25bc480f6f40d567a3000eb10ad310e03fa20eb5f5242005ac97bd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b9748db54b78addaf5e8239cc9cb00308cf77a018e7f941f4f1d05a366cf8c12.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ダイナマイト☆亜美","creatorId":"vndb:s663","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s663","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s663","name":"静木 亜美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3430","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c56035","characterName":"沢渡 かすみ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c56035"},"originalCharacterName":"沢渡 かすみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"26"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"623"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"110"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"96"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"},"weight":